        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nell Williams, Lena Headey, George R. R. Martin, Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Jonathan Rhys Meyers\n- Characters: Cersei Lannister\n- Works: Game of Thrones, A Song of Ice and Fire, London Town\n- Companies: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Nell Williams portrayed a younger version of Cersei Lannister in flashback sequences of the opening episode of Season 5 of HBO's Game of Thrones.\n- In Game of Thrones, Lena Headey portrayed Cersei Lannister as an adult.\n- George R. R. Martin created Cersei Lannister in the A Song of Ice and Fire fantasy novel series.\n- Cersei Lannister is a fictional character in both A Song of Ice and Fire and its television adaptation Game of Thrones.\n- The 2016 film London Town stars Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Nell Williams, and Jonathan Rhys Meyers.",
